          "description": "Buckle up for a high-energy transportation adventure!In this 20-minute journey, children will pretend to drive cars, hear a train-themed story, sail the seas in boats, and soar through the sky in airplanes, and more! Led by Kindermusik’s guided audio, this self-led experience blends movement, music, and pretend play to spark curiosity, support whole-child development, and keep young conductors fully engaged from start to finish.",
